    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30474" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγκῠος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκύὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκύμων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.131
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.42
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶλος ἡσυχίης
			ἔγκυος</span>, of the Trojan horse, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.156
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστρὸς ἀπωσαμέναν μόρον
				ἔγκυον</span>, of one dying in child-birth, <i>Epigr Gr.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				238
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(7).301
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of plants, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				595b27
			</span></i>.</div>
